{ SYNTHETIC coverage probe for tools/ana_to_wasim.py — exercises the mapping
  table and the graceful-degradation paths. Not a real Analytica model. }
Softwareversion 6.4

Model Coverage_probe
Title: Converter coverage probe (synthetic)

Index Scenarios
Title: Scenario axis
Definition: Sequence(1, 5, 1)

Chance U
Title: Uniform draw
Definition: Uniform(0, 10)

Chance N
Title: Normal draw
Units: kg
Definition: Normal(mean: 100, stddev: 15)

Chance T
Title: Triangular draw
Definition: Triangular(1, 2, 4)

Chance B
Title: Beta draw
Definition: Beta(2, 5)

Chance E
Title: Exponential draw (rate form)
Definition: Exponential(0.25)

Variable Prices
Title: Price table
Definition: Table(Scenarios)(10, 12, 15, 9, 11)

Variable Arith
Title: Mixed arithmetic
Definition: Max(U, 3) + Min(N/2, 40) - Abs(T) ^ 2

Variable Funcform_if
Title: Functional If
Definition: If(U > 5, N, B)

Variable Risky
Title: Across-realization probability (gap)
Definition: Probability(Arith > 50)

Variable Weird
Title: Unknown builtin
Definition: SomeExoticFn(U, N, 3)

Function My_helper
Title: A user function (unsupported)
Definition: 2 * x + 1
